@startuml
' Alur end-to-end — docs/proposal/06-proses-bisnis-dan-alur.md §6.1
|Persiapan|
start
:Master data + import CSV;
:Managed config berversi ditarik\ndevice dan AI service;
:Jadwal praktikum;
:Enrollment wajah lokal Core API:\nYuNet + SFace;
:Hanya template terenkripsi + model name-version\ntersimpan; bytes gambar dibuang;
|Pelaksanaan|
:Guru buka sesi + snapshot roster;
:Discovery gallery + cache expiry max 300 dtk;
if (Profil deployment?) then (AI_EDGE)
  :Pipeline recognition-core lokal di PC lab;
else (AI_CENTRAL)
  :STB kirim burst max 5 JPEG ke AI service;
  :Decision + kandidat tanpa image dan embedding;
endif
:Event idempoten ke Core API;
if (Keputusan Core API: otoritas attendance tunggal?) then (matched valid)
  :Record present atau late;
  :Presensi manual bila perlu;
elseif (ambigu)
  :NEED_FRONTAL_RETRY: fallback frontal look;
else (duplikat atau kedaluwarsa)
  :Event audit saja;
endif
|Observabilitas|
:Heartbeat device + camera status;
:Cache dan gallery expiry;
:Health probe Core ke AI service via ai-readiness;
|Penutupan|
:Auto atau manual close sesi;
:Laporan + ekspor;
:EWS watchlist;
:Tindak lanjut manusia;
stop

note right of |Pelaksanaan|
  B10->B4: fallback mengulang sampling/inference.
  B11/B12->C1: selesai pelaksanaan, lanjut penutupan.
  Observabilitas berjalan paralel selama sesi aktif.
end note
@enduml
